      "statement": "Define E63(n)=sum_{j=0}^{62}((-4)^j/4)*n*(log2n)^(-(j+1)); this finite expression is exact. For every N>=2,s in Z/NZ,n=ceil(log2N), ONE physical RLS4L16-FIXEDBANK implementation of proof.md executing COMPLETE virtual RLS-4L P in virtual.md has unconditional WHOLE-secret success at least9/10 for EVERY adversary of the EXACT adaptive malformed-copy model in claim4, with epsilon(n)=1/(4194304n^4). All four envelopes hold jointly on EVERY branch, including arbitrary malformed/entangled inputs, failures, discards, unused blocks, source moves, initialization and cleanup. Guaranteed malformed fraction is EXACTepsilon(n)=1/(4194304n^4) in the verbatim source adaptive model. No measurement/fairbit/helperREAD occurs before last delivery, so adversary-visible outcome history is literally empty throughout acquisition; its possibly E-entangled deliveries are mapped faithfully into fixed held slots. After last delivery it has no access/future supplies. The full arbitrary-reference correlated-CQ/forgetting interpretation preserves P reduced logical channels, uniform permutation, forgotten twirls/F_t outcomes, robust sieve/vote/test and source/output law. Helper readouts are MARGINALIZED, not inserted into original conditional-independence fields. Source Theorems1-2 give success>=9/10 for every N and permitted adversary, including clean. The tolerance counts malformed acquired copies, not a per-copy corruption probability.",
